:: Pale Suits You, Sire {"position":"4300,3000","size":"100,100"}
SPEAKER: Lestat
EMOTION (unlock): Pleased
POPUP (unlock): I felt your blood change. How indecently interesting.
START LOG: Some changes announce themselves beautifully; yours did; blood crossed a threshold, and I felt it; you became a vampire without my invitation. Already, très intéressant. Long ago, Heaven's Peak offered devotion to an Overlord. My priestly splinter refused. We kept the Silent God instead. Piety, appetite, loyalty... people confuse them constantly. I do not. Draw a bottle of your altered blood. Let me see what your choice has made of you. I care about this because it is you, Sire. No other vampire has earned that inconvenience.
OBJECTIVES (voiced): Extract a bottle of your own vampiric blood.
EMOTION (complete): Pleased
POPUP (complete): Beautiful. Changed by choice. That matters.
COMPLETION LOG: Your blood confirms it; no glamour; no gift from me; you chose this hunger, and it chose you. Deliciously mutual, isn't it? Gifts create debts. I prefer curiosity without invoices. The hunters will object, naturellement. They mistake profession for moral certainty. Let one come. Kill him. I want to know what he sees at the fatal moment. A vampire who became an Overlord? Or an Overlord who merely acquired fangs? The distinction should ruin his evening.
CODER NOTES: overlord:tales/pale_suits_you_sire · working title "First Blood" · trigger/objective: quest-specs part 1 (hooks) + part 3 · TAG on unlock: vampire=yes · VOICE: IWTV S01E02 cue 12

