:: Gristle Needs a Stove {"position":"2800,1400","size":"100,100"}
SPEAKER: Gristle
EMOTION (unlock): Relishing
POPUP (unlock): KITCHEN COLD! crime, Masta! give me pot before wall gets bitten!
START LOG: Kitchen cold, Masta, criminal, insulting, almost peaceful! I wake and find no pot, no stew, no smoke worth breathing. Put cooking pot here! Big pot, deep pot, room for meat, roots, mushrooms, anything that stops wriggling after enough heat. Fire up, Brown fingers out! Chop fast, stir faster, taste once, add flame, taste again! Reds still sleep, so I do this myself. Fine! I got two claws and temper enough for twenty cooks!
OBJECTIVES (voiced): Put cooking pot in kitchen, Masta! I make heat happen!
EMOTION (complete): Pleased
POPUP (complete): POT HOT! Good! Kitchen lives, walls safe for now!
COMPLETION LOG: Pot hot, kitchen alive, finally! I got knives, pans, flame, space, and nobody telling me simmer means small fire. Browns keep claws out unless they want spoon across knuckles! Named folk can eat proper while tribes sleep. Strong servants need strong meals, hot meals, big meals! Bring meat, crops, fungus, monster bits, anything that looks edible after enough heat. I cook it, fix it, char it exactly right. Smoke in hall? Planned ventilation test! Entirely deliberate!
