:: Evil Marches on Its Stomach {"position":"2800,1200","size":"100,100"}
SPEAKER: Gristle
EMOTION (unlock): Pleased
POPUP (unlock): kitchen ready, Masta! now cook food that fought back!
START LOG: Kitchen ready, Masta, make real meal! No chewing raw root like sad Brown behind pantry. Hot food, filling food, food that smells strong enough to stop room talking! Chop fast, stir faster, taste once, more fire! Too raw goes back pot, too dry gets sauce, too pale gets flame. Burnt can be perfect when I burn it right. That is skill, not accident! Make one proper plate and show me dinner worthy of Tower!
OBJECTIVES (voiced): Cook one proper meal, Masta! Hot, filling, no excuses!
EMOTION (complete): Pleased
POPUP (complete): GOOD! Real dinner! I almost forgive raw vegetables!
COMPLETION LOG: Good, that is dinner, Masta! Proper plate, proper heat, nothing pretending raw is a style. Browns can stop roasting mushrooms on forge tools now. Named servants get food fit for Tower! Keep dishes coming, strong belly makes strong work, and strong work makes more things to cook. Next I want feast, big table, big smell, enough food nobody steals mine while I turn around. If edge blackens, that is flavour. If whole plate blackens... we call it night cuisine!
CODER NOTES: overlord:the_dark_tower/evil_marches_on_its_stomach · working title "Start with Dinner" · trigger/objective: quest-specs part 1 · VOICE: O1 Minion_-_General_Speech ignore.BurnBurn

