:: Exotic, Probably Toxic [rambling] {"position":"2950,4400","size":"100,100"}
SPEAKER: Blister
EMOTION: Pleased
POPUP: Sssafe? ...probably toxic.
LOG: Bottle looks harmless... that worries me. Exotic mix inside... colours too bright... ssstrange little beauty. Smell like flowers drowning... very promising. I sniff once... nose goes numb. Useful. I lick cork... worse idea... good result. Master... compound bites quick. Fingers feel far away... maybe still attached. I count four... no, five... yesss, five. Toxic? Probably. Beautiful? Definitely. I add tiny black drop... liquid turns clear. Clear always suspicious. Better label bottle... maybe skull, maybe two skulls. Sleeping Greens would love this, when they wake. For now, mine to test. One more taste? ,safe enough.
