:: Vintage From the Crypt [rambling] {"position":"2500,4700","size":"100,100"}
SPEAKER: Gristle
EMOTION: Pleased
POPUP: Old wine! Smells expensive!
LOG: Old bottle, dust thick! Cork black, I like already. Crypt wine got age. Old stuff got bite. Age makes flavour sometimes. Or poison, also useful! I pull cork slow. Smell first, always. Dark fruit, cold stone. Bit grave too. Mortis calls that normal. I pour little cup. Deep red, good colour! Taste burns soft. Niceee! No cooking needed here. Rare kitchen victory. Bottle stays from fire. Wine near flame wastes wine. I know limits. Masta gets cup. I get cook sip. One sip, proper testing. Maybe second test. Third for safety! Bottle empty? Testing successful. No more questions.
