:: Gluttony, Seasoned [rambling] {"position":"2650,4700","size":"100,100"}
SPEAKER: Gristle
EMOTION: Relishing
POPUP: Veg in pot! Make it angry!
LOG: Heat pan, veg goes in! Gluttony with seasoning, YES! Big bowl, bigger bite. I chop fast, stir faster. Ratatouille? Fancy long word. Means veg fighting pot. Veg fears me. I fix argument. HEAT fixes argument! Eggplant goes soft. Pepper turns sweet. Tomato breaks down. Herbs get loud. Good! I taste first. Needs salt still. Taste again, more spice. Taste third time. Perfect, maybe. One more taste! Masta gets rest. Plenty rest, probably. I cooked this one! Remember that. No gentle dish talk! Say gentle, catch pan! This stew got teeth.
