:: Bread That Sinks Ships [rambling] {"position":"2800,4700","size":"100,100"}
SPEAKER: Gristle
EMOTION: Pleased
POPUP: That bread could sink iron!
LOG: Who baked this brick? Bread too heavy! I lift whole loaf. Hnnng, stupid bread! Ship anchor with crust. Crust fights back. I knock table hard. THUD, good weapon! Bad sandwich maybe. Cut thick slice. Knife starts complaining. I complain louder! Inside feels dense. Outside even harder. Toast it? Maybe becomes masonry. Butter it? Butter flees away. Still, Masta got mighty bread. Could stop door. Could stop boat. Could stop teeth! I respect stubborn loaf. Little bit only. Dip in stew. Ah, now useful! Soak it long. Let broth fight back. Bread softens eventually. My fire softens more.
