SPEAKER: Giblet the Sixth
EMOTION: Pleased
POPUP: Scrap! Giblet sees forge-food!
LOG: Heavy scrap! Good scrap! Giblet wants it. Stained stuff too. Smells wrong. Still metal! Old cage broke. Good. Cage pieces remain. Better. Giblet turns broken into sharp. That is forge way. Nothing sad here! Smash gives scrap. Scrap gives blade. Blade gives more smash. Good circle! Giblet understands circles. Not round ones. Work ones. Master brings stained pieces. Giblet stacks them. Thick ones first. Thin ones later. Bad bent bit? Melt it. Weird black bit? Hit it. If sparks scream, hit softer. Maybe. Giblet says maybe. Good scrap never wasted. Forge corner claimed! Giblet spot!
