SPEAKER: Giblet the Sixth
EMOTION: Relishing
POPUP: Blade thirsty! Giblet says feed foes!
LOG: Blade thirsty? Hah! Good blade. Bad manners. Giblet understands. Edge wants blood. Give edge blood! It gets meaner. Very fine. Metal should remember work. This one remembers meals. Giblet rubs thumb near edge. Not on edge! Sixth not stupid. Third did that. Third bled lots. Still finished sword. Proud line! Master holds drinker. Blade looks hungry. Keep it fed. Not with Giblet. Feed foes! Slice. Drink. Slice. Drink. Simple craft. Strange craft. Giblet wants study. Not magic study. Hammer study! Heat it? Maybe bad. Hit spine? Maybe good. Giblet watches first. Then hits.
