SPEAKER: Gristle
EMOTION: Relishing
POPUP: Whole dungeon eaten! Good gut!
LOG: Dungeon menu gone! Ha! Masta ate whole thing. Rats, bones, mushrooms, bits! All gone down. I approve mostly. Some things need sauce. Dungeon teeth included. Some need prayer maybe. Not my problem! Dark-hall food tastes earned. Sweat adds salt. Fear adds nothing. Bad flavour there. I want proper plates though. No eating off stone! Stone dulls good knife. Masta tried every strange dish. Brave mouth, strong gut. I salute gut! Next time bring samples. I make dungeon taste better. Roast crawling things. Stew chewy bits. Fry small ones. Burn ugly ones. On purpose! Ugly needs fire.
