SPEAKER: Gristle
EMOTION: Relishing
POPUP: Monster meat! Finally!
LOG: Bring monster cuts here! Stringy one first. Slimy one second. Biting one last. EXCELLENT! I hate boring meat. Monster food fights knife. Makes cook work harder. I work harder back! Claw meat gets roast. Tentacle gets char. Eye? Blister can have eye. No, eye makes broth. Hm, better. Masta tasted every morsel. Strong stomach! I season half different. Monster cooks nicely. Good mouth research. Best kind! Beast tries eat us? We eat beast! Fair enough. I sharpen cleaver now. Heat pan hotter. Make monster regret edible. Dinner wins tonight.
