:: Bloody Mary, Bottoms Up [rambling] {"position":"1300,4850","size":"100,100"}
SPEAKER: Gristle
EMOTION: Pleased
POPUP: Red drink bites! I like!
LOG: Bloody Mary, red drink! Good start already. Smells sharp, even better. I sip first. MASTA, this bites! Good! Tomato, spice, blood, burn. Tongue wakes hard. Nose wakes harder. Eyes maybe water. Not crying, steam! Cup got attitude. I want hotter. Add pepper, then more. Now cup angry. Perfect! Masta drinks challenge stuff. I drink cook measure. Smaller measure, maybe. Blister puts poison. I put flavour! Big difference there. Finish cup fast. Slow drink lets spice attack. Attack first! Eat greasy thing after. Ham works best. Everything works with ham.
