:: Monster Cuisine [rambling] {"position":"1450,4850","size":"100,100"}
SPEAKER: Gristle
EMOTION: Pleased
POPUP: Dungeon food? Heat fixes!
LOG: I bite monster food. Hm, tastes like claw. Maybe swamp, maybe boot. Hard tell exactly. Chew once, chew again. Still chewing! Tough stupid beast. Need fire now. Need knife too. Patience? Much less. Throw it in pot! Salt, onion, pepper, GO! Boil it hard. Now smell gets better. Maybe. Taste again, YES, much better! Dungeon food becomes kitchen food. That my job. Ugly thing enters. Good thing leaves. Mostly good. Pot screams? Lid stays on. Lid jumps? Sit something heavy there. Not me. Giblet maybe. Heavy little smith.
