:: A Pot for Monsters [rambling] {"position":"1600,4850","size":"100,100"}
SPEAKER: Gristle
EMOTION: Relishing
POPUP: Monster pot here! Bigger flame!
LOG: Set monster pot here! Big belly, thick sides. I slap rim. BONG, nice sound! Pot can take heat. Real heat, finally! Bones go first. Meat goes second. Ugly bits after. Water later maybe. No, fat first! Better idea. Masta got monster pot ready. Good. Hands off bare handle. Handle gets hot fast. Means pot working. Stew climbs out? Stab it down. Stew growls? Stir harder. Stew bites spoon? Use metal spoon! I know monster cooking. Maybe enough. Pot brave. I brave too. Dinner gets less brave boiling.
