:: Every Rotten Thing [rambling] {"position":"3400,6500","size":"100,100"}
SPEAKER: Quaver
EMOTION: Relishing
POPUP: The rotten brood came crawling out from every fen / He hunted every one and made them dead again!
LOG: The rotten things gathered from crypt, field, shoreline, and fen / He hunted the rotters and emptied each rotten den! / One crawled from mud, one lurched through ruin, one groaned through the rain / His weapons supplied every rotting thing one final pain! / I lost track of names once the smell overwhelmed every verse / The catalogue ended, but somehow the odour grew worse! / Rotten things may wander wherever decay gives them birth / He has hunted the whole mouldering family from earth! / The last foul thing fell and the list finally ceased / I request several baths before anyone orders a feast!
