SPEAKER: Giblet the Sixth
EMOTION: Pleased
POPUP: Push harder! Giblet says good shield!
LOG: Push shield harder! Heavy shield. Giblet pushes. Won't budge! Good! Master lifts it. Of course lifts. Giblet impressed. Little annoyed. Shield should feel like wall. This does. Netherite face thick. Rim thicker. Grip strong. No wobble. Excellent. Sixth kicks bottom. Ow. Better. Enemy hits. Enemy gets tired. Then Master hits enemy. Simple. Good. Giblet likes simple. Fifth liked simple too. Fifth got gibbed. Big thing. Shield maybe would've helped. Hm. Sixth keeps making shields stronger. Family learns. Slowly. Very slowly. This one strong enough. Maybe. Hit again!
