:: Wasting a Golden Apple [rambling] {"position":"1300,6650","size":"100,100"}
SPEAKER: Gnarl
EMOTION: Stricken
POPUP: Why would you do that, Master?! That apple had expensive magic in it!
LOG: Why would you do that, Master?! A golden apple, stripped of its enchantment and all that expensive wonder. Gold, magic, rarity, all scraped away for curiosity, Sire. I am impressed by the waste, but not convinced by the wisdom. Such fruit belongs in vaults, rituals, bribes, or greedy hands with poor self-control. Not beneath some little device that peels the power away! Still, the trick proves enchantment can be removed cleanly when desired. That may become useful, my Lord, once we choose a less delicious victim. Next time, ruin something another person paid for.
CODER NOTES: overlord:ramblings/wasting_a_golden_apple · fires on advancement `supplementaries:story/unenchanter` (in-game name "Why Would You do That!?") · no completion popup/entry · see ramblings doc · VOICE: O1 D4_SD5_TheRoyalHalls 200.10


