:: A Terrible Cocktail [rambling] {"position":"2800,6800","size":"100,100"}
SPEAKER: Blister
EMOTION: Relishing
POPUP: Hissss... furious little cocktail.
LOG: Cocktail smells furious... good name then. I line bottles... not straight, hand twitching. One brew hisses... another fumes... third looks innocent. Innocent worst. Master takes them all... brave mouth. I taste droplets left behind... professional duty. First makes tongue warm, second makes knees cold. Third makes heartbeat skip, only one beat. Probably one. I sit down gently, floor feels soft. Hissss, colours stretch. Potions mix inside, argue, bite, settle. I like settlement part. No, arguing part too. Need more, no, enough. Definitely enough. I cork empties, keep labels. Tomorrow maybe labels make sense.
CODER NOTES: overlord:ramblings/a_terrible_cocktail · fires on advancement `minecraft:nether/all_potions` (in-game name "A Furious Cocktail") · no completion popup/entry · see ramblings doc · HOLD until Sit, Sire. Brood. (overlord:the_dark_tower/sit_sire_brood) is COMPLETED (Blister wakes with the room restorations) · if the advancement was earned before that, this Rambling fires on release as CATCH-UP: log entry + toast only, NO popup · VOICE: O1 Minion_-_General_Speech ignore.WeNeedMore01


:: Every Biome Seen [rambling] {"position":"2950,6800","size":"100,100"}
SPEAKER: Grubbison Jr
EMOTION: Pleased
POPUP: Every kind land! Feet hurt good!
LOG: So much country! Cold land, wet land, dry land, dark land, green land, and I ran through all! Feet hurt. Good hurt! Master saw every kind place now, and I tried remember every road between. Old anti-magic shield stopped Grubby. Ground said stop, Grubby knew. Me, I keep asking where next! Ridge after valley, coast after woods, snow after dust. I want one more place! Always one more, yes? Maybe under somewhere. Under counts! Good travel makes good digging. See land first, then tunnels appear in head!
CODER NOTES: overlord:ramblings/every_biome_seen · fires on advancement `minecraft:adventure/adventuring_time` (in-game name "Adventuring Time") · no completion popup/entry · see ramblings doc · VOICE: O2 Empire_Assault 100.10


:: Wings, Borrowed [rambling] {"position":"3100,6800","size":"100,100"}
SPEAKER: Grubbison Jr
EMOTION: Stricken
POPUP: Up, Master? Really up?!
LOG: Up? We go UP? I am digger! Down makes sense! Still, wings open and wind grabs hard, and suddenly ground runs away below me! Master, this is fast! Too fast? Maybe perfect fast! Grubby dug routes beneath feet. I got route with no dirt! That feels wrong. Also exciting! I bank left and wobble right, and nearly become very flat Brown! Recover! Flying works! Grubby was ground-smart. I am sky-stupid today! No, Grubby-ground. Me sky today! Paths everywhere from up here! Roads and rivers and ridges, all connect! Then I land. Please land. Yes! Dirt! I missed dirt!
CODER NOTES: overlord:ramblings/wings_borrowed · fires on advancement `minecraft:end/elytra` (in-game name "Sky's the Limit") · no completion popup/entry · see ramblings doc · VOICE: O1 Minion_-_General_Speech ignore.Charge01


:: The Netherworld Tour [rambling] {"position":"3250,6800","size":"100,100"}
SPEAKER: Grubbison Jr
EMOTION: Pleased
POPUP: Netherworld tour! I found every turn!
LOG: Hot road here, black ridge there, strange glow farther on, and I want see all of it! Netherworld got tunnels without tunnels, paths through fire, cliffs hiding more cliffs! I keep moving! Grubby knew Gates, found them, dug them, and made travel happen for Master. I want know every road around! Legacy looks good from here! Not copying. Learning! I mark safe ledge and unsafe ledge, and very unsafe ledge gets mark twice! Unsafe ledge gets skull mark. No testing! Mortis would approve maybe. I call route learning. Every corner seen, and still I want another!
CODER NOTES: overlord:ramblings/the_netherworld_tour · fires on advancement `minecraft:nether/explore_nether` (in-game name "Hot Tourist Destinations") · no completion popup/entry · see ramblings doc · VOICE: O2 NW_TR START.75


:: Shortcut Through Hell [rambling] {"position":"3400,6800","size":"100,100"}
SPEAKER: Grubbison Jr
EMOTION: Pleased
POPUP: Shortcut! Far place got near!
LOG: Master, shortcut! Big shortcut! We cross hot country and come out far away, and road folds distance like sneaky tunnel! No digging needed. Little disappointing. Very useful though! Grubby made routes from nothing, Gates where Master needed. This does same job different. I respect different! I run path once, then again, timing feet in head. Faster second! Could make marker stones. Could make side tunnel. Could make backup route! Too many ideas! Good problem! Far place becomes near place, and near place becomes home quick. That is digging without dirt. Weird. I like dirt better. I like speed too!
CODER NOTES: overlord:ramblings/shortcut_through_hell · fires on advancement `minecraft:nether/fast_travel` (in-game name "Subspace Bubble") · no completion popup/entry · see ramblings doc · VOICE: O2 Nordberg_Town_Chunk_4 303.5


:: Death, Declined [rambling] {"position":"3550,6800","size":"100,100"}
SPEAKER: Mortis
EMOTION: Pleased
POPUP: Death called. The totem answered instead.
LOG: Death came! You declined. Impolite, but effective. The totem paid instead. That matters. No return is free, Sire. The totem breaks so you continue. Life for death. The balance bends, then settles. Do not rely on the charm too often. Cheating death becomes habit. Habits become assumptions. Assumptions become graves. Keep another totem if you wish. Keep caution as well. It weighs less. The reaper is patient. He has always had excellent attendance. Thank the totem quietly. It fulfilled its purpose. Few charms receive funerals of their own. Even charms deserve respect.
CODER NOTES: overlord:ramblings/death_declined · fires on advancement `minecraft:adventure/totem_of_undying` (in-game name "Postmortal") · no completion popup/entry · see ramblings doc · VOICE: O2 NW_B IGRAVE.45


